	(text_box "BATTERY CHARGER  U3\nFills the battery safely, refuses to charge when too hot or cold, and while docked runs the pod straight from the dock. The brain sets it up over two wires (SCL / SDA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 20.32 0)
		(size 88.9 16.51)
